  ── Install Codex? ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── step 5 of 6 ──

    Codex (1 of 1) installs with its vendor's installer, from https://github.com/openai/codex#readme. It runs in a
    session named install-codex on pi, where you can answer its questions.

      curl -fsSL https://chatgpt.com/codex/install.sh | sh

    ctrl+\ leaves the session running, and comes back here.

    enter run it   s skip   esc stop
